{"id":"c5706cc0c55f220a","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness.md","title":"二进制串代码与三个程序的对应","display":"thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness — 二进制串代码与三个程序的对应","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness","aliases":["72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness"],"display":"thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness — 二进制串代码与三个程序的对应","depends_on":["[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV coding conventions; local complete arithmetic verification of the explicit code","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness — 二进制串代码与三个程序的对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0631285f0a620556\" href=\"?note=0631285f0a620556\" title=\"72-df-binary-sequence-programs\">72-df-binary-sequence-programs</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV coding conventions; local complete arithmetic verification of the explicit code"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n:=|s|\">\\(n:=|s|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,k\\in\\omega\">\\(i,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ c⟧\">\\(⟦ c⟧\\)</span> 是程序解释，非对象函数符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_2:\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_2:\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(\\mathsf{blen})=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}(\\mathsf{bbit})=\\operatorname{ar}(\\mathsf{bpref})=2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ar}(\\mathsf{blen})=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}(\\mathsf{bbit})=\\operatorname{ar}(\\mathsf{bpref})=2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\mathsf{blen}⟧(c_2(s))=n,\\qquad\ni&lt;n\\Rightarrow⟦\\mathsf{bbit}⟧(c_2(s),i)=s_i,\\qquad\nk\\le n\\Rightarrow⟦\\mathsf{bpref}⟧(c_2(s),k)=c_2(s\\!\\upharpoonright k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\mathsf{blen}⟧(c_2(s))=n,\\qquad\ni&lt;n\\Rightarrow⟦\\mathsf{bbit}⟧(c_2(s),i)=s_i,\\qquad\nk\\le n\\Rightarrow⟦\\mathsf{bpref}⟧(c_2(s),k)=c_2(s\\!\\upharpoonright k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>各长度区间连续且互不相交；通常二进制展开在每个区间给唯一串。程序元数按 Rec/Comp 构造逐项检查。长度和统计的有效指数正好是1,…,n，因此和为n。扣去长度偏移后余下低 n 位就是串的数字；整除2ⁱ再取模2读第i位，对2ᵏ取余读前k位，回加2ᵏ−1给前缀代码。n=0的代码为0，前缀k=0仍为0，边界均包含。证明是程序解释的外部正确性，尚不是 RCA₀ 内逐程序的验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-binary-sequence-programs","status":"resolved","id":"0631285f0a620556","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"n:=|s|","display":false},{"tex":"i,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ c⟧","display":false},{"tex":"c_2:\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\omega.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(\\mathsf{blen})=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}(\\mathsf{bbit})=\\operatorname{ar}(\\mathsf{bpref})=2.","display":true},{"tex":"⟦\\mathsf{blen}⟧(c_2(s))=n,\\qquad\ni<n\\Rightarrow⟦\\mathsf{bbit}⟧(c_2(s),i)=s_i,\\qquad\nk\\le n\\Rightarrow⟦\\mathsf{bpref}⟧(c_2(s),k)=c_2(s\\!\\upharpoonright k).","display":true}],"bytes":1841,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"109b0b8d7ee4cec9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$c_2,\\mathsf{blen},\\mathsf{bbit},\\mathsf{bpref}$ 采用 [[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]]，程序解释对应由 [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] 给出。$E_{\\rm PR},\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR},f_c$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]；对象语法固定为 $\\mathcal L_2(E_{\\rm PR})$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"5d6d95eb13748e1d","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-421","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]]"},{"id":"2ae8cb47602b25cd","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[../72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[../72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[../72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[../72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[../72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"7ce9e286b350fbfc","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness|thm-binary-sequence-